<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ruleset name="Java 共通規範" xmlns="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0 https://pmd.sourceforge.io/ruleset_2_0_0.xsd">
  <description>依 tools/java/rule-map.yml 建立；候選規則不在預設集合。</description>
  <!-- JV-TG-026 -->
  <rule name="UnboundedWildcardReturnType" language="java" class="net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.rule.xpath.XPathRule" message="[JV-TG-026] 泛型回傳值 → rules/stacks/java/common/types-and-generics.md#java-generic-return-types" externalInfoUrl="https://github.com/clarkeforwork-coder/dev-rule/blob/main/rules/stacks/java/common/types-and-generics.md#java-generic-return-types">
    <description>只抓回傳型別中的無界 ?（含巢狀），Class&lt;?&gt; 排除；有上下界的萬用字元（契約確實需要）不抓；反射／序列化工具層回傳 List&lt;?&gt; 可能合理，需 suppress；；實證版本：17、8、11。</description>
    <priority>1</priority>
    <properties>
      <property name="xpath"><value><![CDATA[//MethodDeclaration/ClassType[not(pmd-java:typeIs('java.lang.Class'))]//WildcardType[not(*)]]]></value></property>
    </properties>
  </rule>
</ruleset>
